{"title":"Virikh Dragonslayer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 58 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 10 times (2.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>1,909</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>1,815</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>1,909</td><td>in the wilds around 2074, 306</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>1,815</td><td>in the wilds around 2071, 310</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 11 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 59 recorded drops, 6,045 total, 14–340 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×14–340</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 4 of 11 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 2 of 11 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 14 total, 6–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×6–8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-scimitar\" title=\"Titanium Scimitar - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/22b880f27953d48cbeb1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Scimitar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-torso\" title=\"Titanium Torso - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/280b7b80b5d81046f763.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-arms\" title=\"Dragonscale Arms - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 4 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"virikh-spikedhelm\" title=\"Virikh Spikedhelm (titan x1) - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/808ff2fd23d75c5258d0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Spikedhelm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"titanium-longsword\" title=\"Titanium Longsword - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c1a26b20d934bb883929.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1434.6px,-1019.5px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/5/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/5/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:1425.0px;top:987.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1431.1px;top:990.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1436.5px;top:991.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1372.3px;top:1054.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1446.5px;top:1045.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1452.7px;top:999.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1391.8px;top:993.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1439.9px;top:1076.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1427.6px;top:1017.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1414.8px;top:1003.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1446.2px;top:1082.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1396.6px;top:1050.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1378.3px;top:1055.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1405.3px;top:983.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1388.5px;top:987.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1439.1px;top:1046.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1411.4px;top:1010.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1434.4px;top:1082.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1420.3px;top:1016.9px\"></i><i styl